#: fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"use kexec to boot Linux kernels via systemctl (pass twice to enable "
"dangerous fallback to non-systemctl)."
